        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "f44d3532-6439-5966-8967-6deb5480e0f1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Shihad, Morningwood\n- People: Hayley Westenra\n- Companies: Capitol Records\n- Products: The General Electric\n- Places: New Zealand\n\nFacts:\n- In October 1999, Shihad released The General Electric as their fourth album.\n- During their recording career, Shihad produced five number-one studio albums in New Zealand.\n- Shihad held the record for the most number-one albums by any New Zealand artist alongside Hayley Westenra.\n- Shihad also had three top-ten singles in New Zealand.\n- Morningwood was signed to Capitol Records.\n- Morningwood released two albums.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
