        "text": "Page: Shihad. Sentence: During their recording career, Shihad have produced five number-one studio albums, holding the title for most number one records for any New Zealand artist, alongside Hayley Westenra, and three top-ten singles in New Zealand.\nPage: Morningwood. Sentence: Morningwood was signed to Capitol Records and released two albums.\nPage: The General Electric. Sentence: The General Electric is the fourth album released by New Zealand band Shihad in October 1999.",
